 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Contrast: als versus wenn in the past",
     "texto": [
      "**Als** = a single time in the past: **Als ich klein war, lernte ich Schwimmen** (when I was little I learned to swim). **Wenn / Immer wenn** = repetition in the past: **Immer wenn die Sonne schien, gingen wir an den Strand** (whenever the sun shone, we went to the beach)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Syntactic position and time markers",
     "texto": [
      "Just like «als», «wenn» is a subordinating conjunction and places the conjugated verb at the end: **Wenn wir früher frei hatten, fuhren wir ans Meer**. In the main clause there is verb-subject inversion: **fuhren wir**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
